@startuml flujo-boveda-llaves
!theme plain
title Flujo de Autenticacion y Cifrado de Boveda por Usuario

actor Usuario
participant "UI Auth / Vault" as UI
participant "AuthService / VaultService" as Svc
participant "CryptoAdapter\n(Argon2id + AES-256-GCM)" as Crypto
database "SQLite Local\n(vault.db)" as DB

== Login y Desbloqueo de Clave Maestra ==
Usuario -> UI: Ingresa username y password
UI -> Svc: Login(username, password)
Svc -> DB: GetUserByUsername(username)
DB --> Svc: User(password_hash, auth_salt, vault_salt)
Svc -> Crypto: VerifyPassword(password, auth_salt, password_hash)
Crypto --> Svc: OK
Svc -> Crypto: DeriveMasterKey(password, vault_salt)
Crypto --> Svc: masterKey (32 bytes en RAM)
Svc --> UI: Sesion desbloqueada (activeUserID)

== Importacion de Llave .pem ==
Usuario -> UI: Selecciona archivo .pem + nombre
UI -> Svc: ImportKey(activeUserID, name, rawPEM, passphrase)
Svc -> Crypto: Encrypt(masterKey, rawPEM, AAD=userID:keyID)
Crypto --> Svc: encryptedPEM (nonce + ciphertext + tag)
Svc -> DB: SaveSSHKey(id, owner_user_id, name, fingerprint, encrypted_pem)
DB --> Svc: OK
Svc --> UI: Llave guardada de forma segura

@enduml
